src/commands/init.ts:3137:        value: `Run a quick health check: verify the instar server is responding (curl http://localhost:\${INSTAR_PORT:-${port}}/health), check disk space (df -h), and report any issues. Only send a message if something needs attention — silence means healthy. IMPORTANT: If you find issues, describe them in plain conversational language. Never dump raw JSON, field names, error codes, or structured data. The user reads these on their phone — write like you're texting them a quick heads-up. If the health response includes a degradationSummary array, relay those narrative strings directly.`,
