docs/specs/standards-registry-snapshot-refresh.md:375:| Embed the registry text into the built JS bundle | Rejected: a ~250 KB string compiled into `dist` inflates every import path that transitively reaches it, and it makes the constitution invisible to a reader diffing the repo. The readers already take a PATH, so a filesystem artifact needs no adapter. |
