docs/specs/ws52-operator-tap-not-text.md:30:2. **No cross-machine enroll trigger.** `acceptDeliveredMandateCommand` only **stores** the delivered mandate; `AccountFollowMeService.onMandateDelivered()` has **no callers**; nothing polls the store; the scheduler does not lazy-trigger. The proof stalls silently after delivery.
