docs/specs/reports/window10-external-passes/pass34-verdict.md:84:- The original default-Markdown link-destination case is repaired. The focused test proves that the formatted anchor is examined.
docs/specs/reports/window10-external-passes/pass34-verdict.md:86:- The predicate description and structured refusal record now describe both stages.
