   441	
   442	    // Register in agent registry (lifeline entry — uses project dir + "-lifeline" suffix).
   443	    // Registry operations are NON-CRITICAL — the lifeline must survive ELOCKED errors
   444	    // from concurrent agent startups or stale locks. A dead lifeline means the agent
   445	    // becomes permanently unreachable and unrecoverable.
   446	    try {
   447	      registerAgent(
