  1097	      // record that THIS lifeline owns the Telegram poll slot for this token,
  1098	      // so a server starting on the same machine auto-demotes to send-only
  1099	      // instead of double-polling and producing 409 Conflicts. Refreshed on
  1100	      // every successful tick. Best-effort + non-throwing (writeLease swallows
